<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#16263F',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center', paddingBottom: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 6, paddingTop: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 12 }}>CHAPTER 01 · 认识框架</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 14 }}>LangChain 是什么？</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7, marginBottom: 22 }}>
        一个开源的 <span style={{ color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>LLM 应用开发框架</span>——把「调用模型」的脏活累活标准化，让开发者专注于业务逻辑。
      </Text>

      {[
        { n: '01', t: '简化开发', d: '组件化封装提示词、模型、解析器\n像搭积木一样拼出应用' },
        { n: '02', t: '标准化工具链', d: '统一调用接口与最佳实践\n从 prompt 到部署一条龙' },
        { n: '03', t: '生态扩展', d: '海量集成 + 社区组件\n换模型、换向量库只需一行' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.15)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 16px', marginBottom: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 30, fontSize: 13, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{item.n}</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 4 }}>{item.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.5, whiteSpace: 'pre-line' }}>{item.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}

      <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
        <FAIcon name='lightbulb' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 18, height: 18 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5' }}>
          一句话记住：LangChain 之于 LLM 应用，就像 Spring 之于 Java Web
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 5, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 16, boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.12)', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Image
        src='assets/langchain_modular_assembly_line.png'
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 370, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}
      />
      <Box style={{ background: '#EAF2FB', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 18px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>看图理解：LangChain 是标准化装配线</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          模型、提示词、工具与输出沿统一接口连接，开发者专注业务逻辑。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 4 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>03 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
